You see, slashem has some monsters being so much tougher than your 
toughest nethack monsters that you just need the assault rifle to deal 
with them.  Diamond golems, for example.  They reflect every ray attack, 
they have about 400 Hp and they take little damage from a sword attack. 
    So, if you have only 300 Hp and an AC of only -35, you will lose 
against them.  (I think, steel golems are even worse, having heard they 
might damage your sword...)  So a rifle is about the only way to get 
them down.  You can of course run away from them but that is not always 
good for proceeding.  So I think, fire arms are a nice addition, 
allowing to keep the game feasible after a certain level.
